---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import SystemTour from "../components/SystemTour.astro";
import QuickFacts from "../components/QuickFacts.astro";
import { site } from "../lib/site";
import headerImage from "../assets/images/installation-header.jpg";

const primaryCta = site.phoneNumber && site.phoneNumber !== "PHONE_NUMBER"
  ? { href: `tel:${site.phoneNumber}`, text: `📞 ${site.phoneNumber}` }
  : { href: "/contact/", text: "📞 Call for a Free Consultation" };
---

<Layout
  title={`Water Softener Installation in ${site.city}, ${site.stateAbbr}`}
  description={`Professional water softener installation in ${site.city}, ${site.stateAbbr}. Sized for ${site.gpgLow}–${site.gpgHigh} GPG from ${site.waterAuthority}. Free water test included. Same day service. No obligation.`}
>
  <PageHero
    breadcrumbs={[{ label: "Installation" }]}
    heading={`Water Softener Installation in ${site.city}, ${site.stateAbbr} | Trusted Local Specialists`}
    primaryCta={primaryCta}
    secondaryCta={{ href: "/quote/", text: "Get a Free Water Softener Quote in Albuquerque" }}
    image={headerImage}
  >
    <p slot="opening">
      <a href="/" class="brand-link">{site.businessName}</a>
      {" "}offers professional installation services, such as single-tank, dual-tank, and whole-home combo
      systems, sized to {site.city}'s {site.gpgLow}–{site.gpgHigh} GPG reading from {site.waterAuthority},
      across {site.city} and {site.county}. We size every installation to your household water usage, not a
      statewide estimate. Licensed and insured. Free in-home water hardness test included with every
      consultation. Written quote before any work begins. Same day service available.
    </p>
  </PageHero>

  <QuickFacts />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <p>Installed pricing depends on system size, water hardness, and existing plumbing. Every quote reflects your actual household size and {site.city}'s {site.gpgLow}–{site.gpgHigh} GPG reading, not a national average. Get a free quote for exact pricing on the three tiers below.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-3">
        <div class="card">
          <p class="card-title">Entry-Level Tier</p>
          <p>A single-tank softener sized for smaller households and moderate hardness, such as a starter one-bathroom home, with exact pricing confirmed during your free water test.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="card-title">Standard Tier</p>
          <p>A system sized for {site.gpgLabel.toLowerCase()} water and average household sizes, the most common installation in {site.city}, with exact pricing confirmed during your free water test.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="card-title">Whole-Home Combo Tier</p>
          <p>A softener and filtration combo system for large households or additional filtration needs, with exact pricing confirmed during your free water test.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="section-footnote">{site.waterAuthority} reports the same {site.gpgLow}-{site.gpgHigh} GPG figure behind every one of these price tiers. Get a free quote to see which tier fits your home.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="background: var(--color-surface);">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Why Local Installation Matters</h2>
        <p>Installing at the correct grain capacity for {site.city}'s {site.gpgLow}–{site.gpgHigh} GPG water is critical: an undersized system leaves hardness minerals behind, while an oversized one wastes salt and water. Local installers who know {site.county}'s plumbing codes and water conditions get sizing and permitting right the first time.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-2">
        <div class="card">
          <p class="card-title">Correct Sizing</p>
          <p>We calculate grain capacity from your household size and {site.city}'s actual hardness reading, not a generic national average. See the full <a href="/water-softener-sizing/">sizing guide</a> for the formula.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="card-title">Code-Compliant Plumbing</p>
          <p>Proper bypass valves, drain lines, and electrical work matter for a system that lasts in any {site.city} home. Local permit or code requirements vary by project. We confirm exactly what applies to your home before installation begins.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="section-footnote">This sizing approach holds for every {site.city} ZIP code, per {site.waterAuthority}'s own service data. Contact us to confirm yours.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Installation Options in {site.city}</h2>
        <p>Four situations come up most often, such as new construction and correct sizing. Each one has its own dedicated guide, covering the specific process:</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-2">
        <div class="card">
          <p class="card-title">Choosing Salt-Based</p>
          <p>Ion exchange removes hardness minerals entirely. See <a href="/salt-based-installation/">Salt-Based Water Softener Installation in Albuquerque</a> for the full process and cost.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="card-title">Choosing Salt-Free</p>
          <p>No sodium, no drain line, no regeneration cycle. See <a href="/salt-free-installation/">Salt-Free Water Conditioner in Albuquerque</a> to check the tradeoffs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="card-title">Sizing It Correctly</p>
          <p>Grain capacity by household size at {site.city}'s {site.gpgLow}-{site.gpgHigh} GPG. See the <a href="/water-softener-sizing/">Water Softener Sizing Guide for Albuquerque Homes</a> for the formula.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="card-title">Building New</p>
          <p>Planning rough-in before drywall goes up. See <a href="/new-construction-installation/">Water Softener Installation for New Construction in Albuquerque</a> for what to coordinate with your builder.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="section-footnote">{site.waterAuthority} reports the {site.gpgLow}-{site.gpgHigh} GPG figure applies to every option above. Explore each guide for the specific process.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <SystemTour />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Financing and Trial Availability</h2>
        <p>Ask about available financing options, such as monthly-payment or promotional-rate plans, during your free quote. Trial and test-period availability is confirmed on a per-installation basis. Get a free quote for the exact terms available on your {site.city} installation.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-dark">
    <div class="container final-cta">
      <h2>Get an Exact Installation Quote</h2>
      <p>Every {site.city} home is different. {site.waterAuthority} reports one citywide figure, but get a free quote based on your actual water hardness and household size.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/quote/">Get a Free Water Softener Quote in Albuquerque</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .card-title { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--surface-footer); margin: 0 0 8px; }
    .section-footnote { margin-top: 16px; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); }
    .final-cta { text-align: center; }
    .final-cta p { max-width: 48ch; margin: 0 auto 24px; }
  </style>
</Layout>
